Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候  童年对我来说如此遥远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some days, my childhood feels so very far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And others,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却又感觉历历在目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can almost see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.95,0:00:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,养育我的那片神奇土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The magical land of my youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宛如一场美梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like a beautiful dream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时世界于我  有无限希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of when the whole world felt like a promise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而未来的教训  尚未得预见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the lessons that lay ahead yet unseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.63,0:00:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回顾童年  我真希望自己用心倾听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking back, I wish I'd listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望自己更仔细地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish I'd watched more closely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观察和体会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有时候  直到拨云见日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But sometimes you can't see what you're learning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会豁然开朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you come out the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾见证这比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen this contest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令身经百战的勇士也低头  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}humble even the most seasoned warriors, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:02:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.18,0:03:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽力就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伟大并非你所想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}greatness is not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找准节奏  耐心观察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pace yourself and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你走了捷径  - 但...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You took the short path. - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.93,0:09:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你作弊了  戴安娜  - 不  但那...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You cheated, Diana. - No. But that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是唯一的真相  真相就是一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the only truth, and truth is all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我本来能赢的  要不是你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I would've won, if you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你没有赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能赢  因为你还没准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot be the winner, because you are not ready to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:56.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什么好羞愧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there is no shame in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心中明知真相却拒绝接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in knowing the truth in your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是可耻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not accepting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谎言中诞生不出真正的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No true hero is born from lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的胜利会到来的  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your time will come, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你准备好后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以黄金战士阿斯忒瑞亚为榜样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look to the Golden Warrior Asteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是靠急功近利成为传奇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did not become a legend out of haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她凭借的是真正的勇敢之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did it through true acts of bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如耐心  勤勉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like patience, diligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及面对真相的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the courage to face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天  你会实现自己的梦想  超出梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, you'll become all that you dream of and more,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时一切都会不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everything will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界还没准备好迎接你未来的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world is not yet ready for all that you will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《神奇女侠1984》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生活已很美好  但还可以更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is good, but it can be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why shouldn't it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们曾经梦想的一切  如今都唾手可得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything we've ever dreamed about is right at our fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的收获如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But are you reaping the rewards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.89,0:11:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(可通行)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 慢点  老兄  - 没门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slow down, dude. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到黑金合作社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Black Gold Cooperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 天啊  - 第一家由人民经营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my gosh. Guys! - The first oil company
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为人民服务的石油公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}run for the people, by the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试想终于能拥有你梦寐以求的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about finally having everything you've always wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需每月付一点点费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a low monthly fee,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就可以在世上最赚钱的行业中占分一杯羹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can own a piece of the most lucrative industry in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次我们发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time we strike gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.99,0:12:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一起发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you strike gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是谁  从事什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter who you are, no matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你都值得拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you deserve to have it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否拥有了梦寐以求的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have everything you've ever wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是否厌倦了总是想要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you tired of always wishing you had more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让开  该我了  - 今天就加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, move it. It's my turn. - Join me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了  - 接线员随时待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes! - Operators are standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不需要腰缠万贯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need a pile of money or
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是商科毕业才能起步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some business degree to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你甚至不用为之努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even have to work hard for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 早上好  - 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别做小动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入黑金合作社  你只需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At Black Gold Cooperative, all you need
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大胆去想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is to want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(黑金合作社)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拿了东西就会离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get what we want, and we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们想要什么  - 不是这堆破烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - None of this junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有传言说你们的黑市副业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word is on the street you got a nice little black market
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞得风生水起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}side business going on back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以帮彼此保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't tell, we won't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.07,0:13:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.49,0:13:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:14:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧  藏不住了  我们快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, dude. Can't hide. Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住  商场保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Mall Security!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动  就是你  你站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, you, you, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.52,0:14:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住  不许动  停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there! Freeze. Stop!
