Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很乐意协助你  - 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would love to assist you. - Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经认识过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  23号物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, item number 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  不是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot. That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暹罗女皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Empress of Siam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初发现于阿卡托夫人号沉船的残骸中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Originally found in the wreck of the Nuestra Senora de Atocha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我忍不住想来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I couldn't resist coming to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.11,0:22:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.58,0:22:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.38,0:22:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来点灯光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得用专业术语来说应该是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the technical term here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"超级没劲"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is "extremely lame."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.93,0:23:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是黄水晶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... It's citrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.33,0:23:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从古至今广泛用于造假的石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A classic stone used in fakes throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.52,0:23:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看这东西价值最多75美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't imagine this is worth any more than $75.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.95,0:23:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.79,0:23:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴伪不是我的专长  不过我来看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fakes aren't my forte, but let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.16,0:23:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉丁语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.37,0:23:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好歹是个古董吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least it's an antique, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能是上周在佛罗伦萨老桥上的摊位买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a purchase from a stall on the Ponte Vecchio last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.61,0:23:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"握持此物  许一宏愿"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Place upon the object held but one great wish."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.79,0:23:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会拉丁语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You read Latin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.32,0:23:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  语言算是我的爱好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. Languages are a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.34,0:23:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许这是个幸运物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So maybe it's, like, a lucky charm or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真希望能喝杯咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really wish I had a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真幽默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给艾瑞卡买了杯咖啡  但她请病假了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I got Erika a coffee, but she's out sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人要喝吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anybody want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  好啊  我来喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Yeah, I'll take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:23:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烫  好烫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, hot! Hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.83,0:23:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.98,0:24:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是真货  你能想象吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.04,0:24:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是真货就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.97,0:24:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿望太多  我都不知道该许哪一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many things, I don't even know what I would wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.66,0:24:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  抱歉打扰你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, um, anyway, sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有需要  随时可以找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need anything, I'm around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  现在没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你刚刚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But thank you for...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客气  这是我的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay. It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我有机会了再深入研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll look into it more when I have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.78,0:24:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks for...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主动跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.25,0:24:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm sorry, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.87,0:24:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.29,0:24:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说  我们可以早点去吃晚饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we could go and grab early dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聊聊这块石头有多没劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and talk about exactly how lame that stone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.40,0:24:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.34,0:24:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  黄水晶  不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I mean, citrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:24:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能唬住谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.34,0:25:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太没劲了  - 真傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So lame. - Dorky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 超没劲  - 是啊  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lame. - Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.23,0:25:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是没劲中的没劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's, like, the lamest of lames.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.12,0:25:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太幽默了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.79,0:25:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经很久没人让我笑得这么痛快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, no one's made me laugh like this in such a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实  我不怎么出门社交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's true, I don't get out much socially.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不怎么出门  - 对  不常出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't get out much? - No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 抱歉  我有点惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - I'm sorry. I'm just surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.64,0:25:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你看起来像是那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you just seem like the kind of person
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从不回家的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's, like, always out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天天都有人约你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, people are asking you to go out all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.45,0:25:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你经常出门  总在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you live out. You're just out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.84,0:25:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来不待在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, you never get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.58,0:26:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起像是非常受欢迎的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just seem like you'd be really popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能看出来  因为我从来都不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I would know because I've never been popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.35,0:26:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.35,0:26:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么好相处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so personable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.37,0:26:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  我挺羡慕你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, honestly, I gotta say that I envy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.85,0:26:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.75,0:26:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你羡慕我  这根本说不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You envy me? That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家觉得我很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People think I'm weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.64,0:26:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们当面躲着我  背后说我坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They avoid me and talk behind my back
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.88,0:26:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我听不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they don't think I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.12,0:26:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想说  "我听得一清二楚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like, "Guys, I can hear you."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.27,0:26:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉  我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara, my life
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.74,0:26:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概和你想象的不太一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hasn't been what you probably think it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.08,0:26:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都有自己的难处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have our struggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.95,0:26:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.70,0:26:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你谈过恋爱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever been in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.81,0:26:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.76,0:26:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A long, long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.33,0:26:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.04,0:26:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是情场老手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many times, yeah. All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.69,0:26:57.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Often.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来如何了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你男友  他去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd he go, your guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有时我抬头仿佛还能看到他在天上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I still think sometimes that I see him up there in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.95,0:27:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是飞行员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.37,0:27:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有很多特点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was all kinds of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他真的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he was great. It was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.67,0:27:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.62,0:27:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为我们干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, cheers to us.
