Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.08,0:34:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.97,0:34:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  你舞跳得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my gosh. You're such a good dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.44,0:34:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢拉丁舞吗  - 可喜欢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You like Latin dancing? - I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.95,0:34:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我跳得很差劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that I'm a terrible dancer.
