Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你陪我参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.71,0:35:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚你一定要来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have to see you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.09,0:35:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.13,0:35:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  祝你愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye. Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.77,0:35:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不见不散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll find you.
