Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.53,0:36:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗马不是一天建成的  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rome wasn't built in a day, was it? No.
