Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.32,0:36:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爸爸要成为超凡卓绝的头号人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it takes time to become a great, great, number-one man,
