Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.73,0:37:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想听了  我要退出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to hear it anymore. I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.25,0:37:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里斯特  去找拉克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair, go wait with Raquel.
