Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.73,0:37:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去骗几个我这样的倒霉投资人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get more sucker investors, like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.59,0:37:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这叫庞氏骗局  - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's called a Ponzi scheme. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个大...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a big...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:43.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的计划正在进行中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something in the works.
