Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.37,0:37:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的石油开采权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have oil rights on land
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.70,0:37:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是在别人放弃不要的土地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that everyone else passed on already.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.03,0:37:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查清这事没费多少功夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it didn't take much digging to find that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也该早点查查你的底细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have done some digging on you, too,
