Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我有计划  - 别扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- with a plan. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.84,0:38:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有宏大的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With... With... With a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.65,0:38:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"只要敢想  就能实现"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"If you can dream it, you can have it."
