Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.21,0:38:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把钱还给我  - 你会后悔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to get my money... - You're going to regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.56,0:38:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则联邦贸易委员会将收到匿名举报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or the FTC gets an anonymous report.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 窝囊废  - 西蒙  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Loser. - Simon, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西蒙  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simon, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.33,0:38:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是窝囊废\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a loser.
