Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.13,0:38:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不要相信那个人说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't you ever believe a word that man said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.98,0:38:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.44,0:38:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.96,0:39:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会后悔离开了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he will rue the day he walked away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.49,0:39:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.58,0:39:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会为有我这个爸爸而骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are going to be so proud to be my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.18,0:39:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.71,0:39:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see.
