Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.74,0:42:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是你这样的漂亮女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially not a beautiful woman like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.42,0:43:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  这里太吵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, it's so loud in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
