Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.27,0:43:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有我和你  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just me and you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.53,0:43:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你办公室吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your office?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.63,0:43:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这些东西  太...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all of this stuff. It's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.99,0:43:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.39,0:43:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you.
