Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.97,0:43:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过到目前为止  我毫无头绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though it certainly has me stumped so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.32,0:43:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you.
