Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.41,0:44:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗马古物  - 如果你愿意  可以帮你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roman antiquities. - Could give it a look, if you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.42,0:44:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面是拉丁语吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Latin, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.38,0:44:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不能让它离开博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really shouldn't let it go out of the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.41,0:44:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  美人  - 不了  谢谢  失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey there, beautiful. - No, thank you. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.55,0:44:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.
