Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.83,0:44:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.89,0:44:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在实习  但是点名请我去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interning, but requested by name, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.88,0:44:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我关注你有一段时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I've had my eyes on you for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.57,0:44:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果你需要...  - 太好了  卡尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So if you ever need... - That's great, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.67,0:44:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.55,0:44:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.80,0:45:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  我根本不认识你  别再跟着我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, I don't even know you, so please stop following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.02,0:45:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 晚安  - 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night. - But...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.96,0:45:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望我们能有更多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish we had more time.
