Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.19,0:45:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.46,0:45:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来拯救今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can save today...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you can save the world.
