Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.67,0:45:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.39,0:46:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.33,0:46:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.33,0:46:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.55,0:46:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.19,0:46:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.56,0:46:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还记得什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.24,0:46:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.72,0:46:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得把飞机开上天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember taking the plane up...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.45,0:46:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就什么都不记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.04,0:46:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片空白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.24,0:46:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我却知道自己之后就去了一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But somehow, I know I've been someplace since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.13,0:46:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someplace that's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.25,0:46:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我难以形容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't really put words to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.06,0:47:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但很好的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's... It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.80,0:47:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我在这里醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I, uh... I woke up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.15,0:47:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.11,0:47:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ended up in a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇奇怪怪的床  软绵绵的  架在板条上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange, strange pillow bed with slats.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.17,0:47:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那是床垫  - 床垫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A futon, yeah. - A futon?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.90,0:47:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.24,0:47:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太舒适  感觉时代有点倒退了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not comfortable. And really a bit backwards
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.33,0:47:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I'm being really honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.56,0:47:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟现在是未来时代了  现在是19...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, for a futuristic time like this. Nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.10,0:47:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,84年  1984年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighty-four. 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.57,0:47:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太惊人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想来看看我的床垫吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to see my futon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.57,0:48:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.23,0:48:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你多说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.48,0:48:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方乱糟糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The place is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.47,0:48:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓶装奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheese on demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.17,0:48:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一上午都在打扫他的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent all morning cleaning his bedroom, but
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.55,0:48:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎是个工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he seems to me to be an engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.38,0:48:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多他自己的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lots of pictures of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.90,0:48:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会干这种事  但人各有所好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not what I would do, but to each his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.95,0:48:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是这样找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is how you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.78,0:48:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  用电话簿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.18,0:48:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些东西永远不过时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess some things are just future-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.46,0:48:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去我家找我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you went to my apartment?
