Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.62,0:57:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.53,0:57:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快看这双鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have you seen these shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.90,0:57:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鞋就穿着吧  - 鞋可以穿  太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's keep the shoes. - Let's keep the shoes. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.87,0:57:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 鞋没问题  - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's keep the shoes. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.78,0:57:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个有点特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a special one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.30,0:57:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.18,0:57:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一脚先  一脚后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One foot after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.66,0:57:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在这一节上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now stay on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.34,0:57:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站到中间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.55,0:57:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别  史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Steve...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.66,0:57:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫  你会摔下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, you're gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.29,0:57:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的以为会摔下去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really thought I was gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.05,0:57:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.59,0:58:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是霹雳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is break dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.51,0:58:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这也算舞蹈  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dancing? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.10,0:58:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.65,0:58:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没事的  只是个舞蹈动作  - 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's fine. It's just a move. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.19,0:58:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.53,0:58:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是艺术品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all art.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.49,0:58:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.04,0:58:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是垃圾桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just a trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.88,0:58:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是垃圾桶  好  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a trash can. Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.88,0:58:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是飞机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.47,0:59:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  我带你参观一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.24,0:59:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.01,0:59:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次我们发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time we strike gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.34,0:59:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一起发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you strike gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.55,0:59:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试想终于能拥有你梦寐以求的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about finally having everything you've always wished for.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.18,0:59:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.02,0:59:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raquel?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.81,0:59:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raquel?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.07,0:59:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑金合作社  请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Gold. Can you hold, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.36,1:00:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑金合作社  是的  请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Gold. Yes. Hold, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.45,1:00:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拉克尔  - 请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Raquel? - Hold, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.16,1:00:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,油井挖到石油了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wells struck pay!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.37,1:00:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪个油井  - 全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which ones? - All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.87,1:00:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投资人不知从哪里得到的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the investors heard about it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.50,1:00:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都打电话来追加投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're calling to up their buys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.71,1:00:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的朋友也打来要入股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their friends are calling to buy in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.29,1:00:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知从哪里冒出很多新的投资人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New investors are calling out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.29,1:00:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请稍等  我需要帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, please. I need more help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.38,1:00:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 黑金合作社  请稍等  - 我给你找帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Black Gold. Can you hold, please? - I'll get you help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.38,1:00:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跟我说一次  你希望有更多帮手吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me again. You wish you had more help?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.68,1:00:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我希望有更多帮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I wish I had more help.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.30,1:00:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话太多接不过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are just too many calls to take.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.45,1:00:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.72,1:00:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.68,1:00:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来要去一家会计公司面试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm meant to be interviewing at an accounting firm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.06,1:00:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被录用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hired!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.60,1:00:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.94,1:00:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我是爱默生  - 爱默生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Emerson. - Emerson!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.40,1:00:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是就业中心吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the employment office?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.94,1:00:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  你也被录用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! You're hired, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.69,1:00:43.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德先生  是《华尔街日报》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Lord, it's Wall Street Journal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.15,1:00:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想就公司的突然翻盘来采访你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to interview you about company's sudden surge.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.41,1:00:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去我的办公室接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it in my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.08,1:00:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的维生素拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bring me my vitamins.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.67,1:00:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨晚真的读了四本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I did read about four books last night...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.88,1:00:59.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试图把这玩意研究透彻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to try to get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.09,1:01:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我发现  罗杰你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And did find out, Roger, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.59,1:01:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个确实是宋代的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is from the Song Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.01,1:01:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外有趣的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And also interesting,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.05,1:01:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨晚看了几本百科全书  你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was looking at a couple of encyclopedias last night and you...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.14,1:01:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.64,1:01:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪  看这么多书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So funny, all this reading seems
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.98,1:01:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎把我的近视眼治好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have cured my eyesight somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.98,1:01:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的是  我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting fact which we...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.45,1:01:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.94,1:01:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是史蒂夫  他是我的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Steve. He's my, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.11,1:01:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老朋友  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Old friend. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.11,1:01:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  老朋友史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, old friend Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.03,1:01:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是芭芭拉  戴安娜的新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Barbara, Diana's new friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.16,1:01:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是做什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.70,1:01:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是飞行员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.20,1:01:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 飞行员  那不是...  - 我能跟你谈几句吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pilot? Isn't that... - Can I speak to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.83,1:01:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.25,1:01:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想跟你谈谈那块石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I just wanted to speak to you about that stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.63,1:01:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那块黄水晶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The citrine one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.34,1:01:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它还在你这里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.59,1:01:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long story, actually, about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.72,1:01:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦克斯·罗德昨天来了一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max Lord came by to visit yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.22,1:01:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还挺愉快的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which was actually pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.73,1:01:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后再跟你细说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you about it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.60,1:02:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let him
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.77,1:02:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借给他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}borrow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.48,1:02:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.98,1:02:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Diana,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.98,1:02:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才给我们捐了一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he just gave us a huge amount of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.32,1:02:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又不是什么陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like he's a stranger or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.86,1:02:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他有个朋友是专家  于是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus he has a friend who's an expert, and I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.57,1:02:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么  你怎么能借出去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? How could you loan it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.24,1:02:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本不是我们的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even ours to loan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.15,1:02:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛冲我嚷嚷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you getting on my case for?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.66,1:02:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我办公室多得是比那石头珍贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got 15 things in my office more valuable than that stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.12,1:02:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他把石头拿去哪了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where he took it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.46,1:02:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们有发现再通知你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll tell you what we find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.01,1:02:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.76,1:02:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很喜欢你的裤子  - 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like your pants very much. - Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.80,1:02:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得打给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.09,1:02:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不打也行  随便吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.55,1:02:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我想听后续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'd be curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.69,1:02:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请拨打黑金热线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the Black Gold hotline.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.36,1:02:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此处不售卖股票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shares are not available in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.82,1:02:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these people doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.78,1:02:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.91,1:02:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那条路是进不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're not getting in that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.25,1:02:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  戴安娜  走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana. Diana, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.55,1:03:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.27,1:03:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好结实的锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.58,1:03:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.22,1:04:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 落满了灰尘  - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's so dusty. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.06,1:04:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟爆炸现场似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a bomb went off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.03,1:04:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(商场劫案涉案古物运往史密森尼博物馆  有消息称珍贵文物失而复得)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.03,1:04:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论这是什么  他已经找了很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this is, he's been looking for it for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.09,1:04:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"握持此物"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Place upon the object held."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.64,1:04:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.97,1:04:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是众神的语言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The language of the Gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.43,1:04:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是  这是哪个神写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which God wrote it, is the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.73,1:04:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢了  - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. Oh, yeah. - Yeah. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.82,1:04:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有点事  回头再聊  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go do something. Okay. I'll talk to you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.36,1:04:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 芭芭拉  我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Barbara, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.66,1:04:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你找出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to find out
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.57,1:05:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那块石头被发现的确切地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly where that stone was found.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.66,1:05:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要知道地点  明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Where" is what I need to know. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.96,1:05:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白  我这就着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.12,1:05:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.21,1:05:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的表情像撞见鬼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you saw a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.67,1:05:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确撞见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.22,1:05:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世上曾经有很多神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were many Gods
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.93,1:05:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们出于不同的目的做不同的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they did different things for different reasons.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.39,1:05:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一件事就是制造这样的物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One was making objects like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.90,1:05:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界中有许多通用元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are universal elements in this world,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.15,1:05:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当它们被注入容器之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and when they're imbued into something,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.61,1:05:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会变得强大无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can become very, very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.61,1:05:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如我的真言套索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like my Lasso of Truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.70,1:05:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的力量源泉是真相  而不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is what powers it, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.99,1:05:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真相的力量比我们都强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.12,1:05:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是什么给了它力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.71,1:05:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.96,1:05:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然能带我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.38,1:05:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是爱  或是希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love or hope...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.93,1:06:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.85,1:06:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.60,1:06:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什么  我敢保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever it is, I can promise you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.39,1:06:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这对麦克斯韦尔·罗德而言太过强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is too powerful for Maxwell Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.02,1:06:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.62,1:06:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.49,1:06:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果日期正确  他出发去开罗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this date's right, he's going to Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.87,1:06:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cairo?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.86,1:06:29.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(旅客票根)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.08,1:06:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  大概是去谈合作吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Growth opportunity, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.25,1:06:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"原油之王"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"King of Crude"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.92,1:06:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旅程用时也太短了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this so fast?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.51,1:06:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有飞机能从这里直飞开罗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a plane that can fly from here to Cairo in one shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.93,1:06:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.10,1:06:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  但你不能坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but we can't get you on one
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.51,1:06:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你没有护照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you don't have a passport.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.52,1:06:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想坐飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to get on one,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.39,1:06:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想开飞机  我想开这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to fly one. I want to fly the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.77,1:06:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想开这种飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to fly this plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.44,1:06:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.09,1:07:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my Betsy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.60,1:07:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫  这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Steve, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.43,1:07:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.39,1:07:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧这大轮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these gams.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.07,1:07:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挑一架吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna choose?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.54,1:07:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.93,1:08:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.10,1:08:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.81,1:08:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.86,1:08:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞定  很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.19,1:08:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,燃料  燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel, fuel, fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.48,1:08:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  发动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. Engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.20,1:08:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豁出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.01,1:08:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 肯  - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ken? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.09,1:08:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有架飞机上跑道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an aircraft on the runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.84,1:08:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫"有架飞机上跑道了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "There's an aircraft on the runway"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.63,1:08:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呼叫进近管制员  这里是塔台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approach, this is Tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.47,1:08:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有架未登记的飞机上了跑道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an unlisted aircraft on the runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.93,1:08:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.73,1:08:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能飞起来吗  - 当然  当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you get us up there? - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.27,1:08:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得先加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just have to pick up speed first,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.85,1:08:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then I'll take off.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.40,1:09:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭我的技术  他们休想找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I fly, they will never find us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.25,1:09:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我忘跟你说了  - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I forgot to tell you. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.95,1:09:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达  三言两语解释不清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radar. I can't explain now,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.37,1:09:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们去哪他们都能找到  黑夜里也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they'll see us anywhere, even in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.83,1:09:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他们会朝我们开枪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, will they shoot at us?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.71,1:09:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这下糟了  戴安娜  - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, shit, Diana. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.67,1:09:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我想到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Shh! I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.80,1:09:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了  集中精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.85,1:09:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.93,1:09:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲把整个天堂岛藏起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father hid Themyscira from the world,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.02,1:09:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想学他这一招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've been trying to learn how he did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.23,1:09:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.39,1:09:38.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made something invisible.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.56,1:09:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但五十年来  我只成功过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in 50 years, I've only done it once.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:42.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正是练习的好时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now's not a bad time to start trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.53,1:09:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能维持多久  - 我不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long does it last? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.49,1:09:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时用的是咖啡杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just a coffee cup...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.11,1:09:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且被我弄没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.60,1:10:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进近管制员  那架飞机消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approach, the aircraft has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.35,1:10:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看见它吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have eyes on it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.13,1:10:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An invisible jet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.53,1:11:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.41,1:11:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.04,1:11:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是烟花而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.54,1:11:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是四号（美国独立日）  怪不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fourth. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.04,1:11:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七月四号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fourth of July?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.04,1:11:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.80,1:12:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.47,1:12:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's the one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.84,1:12:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直把这看作是你的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one thing that's always been you to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.93,1:12:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.76,1:12:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.18,1:13:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.89,1:13:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远也搞不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.10,1:13:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.19,1:13:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so easy, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.44,1:13:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是风和气流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's wind and air
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.82,1:13:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掌握如何驾驭气流  乘风而行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and knowing how to ride it, how to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.82,1:13:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,融入天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How to join with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.50,1:13:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道理都是相通的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's like anything, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.98,1:13:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.03,1:13:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了最后一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.45,1:13:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能让你看上一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This should keep you busy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.91,1:14:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么需要吗  咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else I can get you? Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.83,1:14:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.46,1:14:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.00,1:14:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我来说没用  我看完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need anything from you, and I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.75,1:14:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就看完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're done?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.82,1:14:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话不用这么刻薄吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to be mean about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.68,1:14:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美女  你要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, babe. Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.73,1:14:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.02,1:14:32.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, you're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.65,1:14:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢点  美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, slow down, sexy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.87,1:14:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在跟我说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.08,1:14:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我在跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.37,1:14:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不慢一点呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just slow down a bit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.58,1:14:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  妹子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.63,1:14:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想  你懂我意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather not. You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.96,1:14:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想跟你这种人有任何瓜葛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather not have anything to do with someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.34,1:15:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要你别再骚扰别人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather you stop harassing people.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.14,1:15:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.76,1:15:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.89,1:15:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.69,1:15:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起来了  上次到哪一步了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember. Where were we, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.90,1:15:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.30,1:15:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.87,1:15:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.21,1:15:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.59,1:15:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实不难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.84,1:15:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在理解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.43,1:15:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是借力打力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His body weight does do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.35,1:15:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.69,1:15:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.07,1:15:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以打上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.24,1:16:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.74,1:16:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}night...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.45,1:16:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}long!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.06,1:16:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.27,1:16:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.56,1:16:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少管闲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind your business.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.57,1:16:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.33,1:16:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少可以这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fortune the last few days
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.96,1:16:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近几天你的运气引人瞩目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been impressive, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.51,1:17:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你为什么大老远跑来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why come all this way to meet with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.09,1:17:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来见同道中人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To meet a peer.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.89,1:17:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同道中人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A peer?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.47,1:17:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  罗德先生  我只是出于好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Mr. Lord. I only agreed to meet with you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.64,1:17:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才同意与你见面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I was curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.64,1:17:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能这么幸运  你是怎么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one gets that lucky. How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.40,1:17:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在自我实现的道路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my journey to self-fulfillment...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.28,1:17:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我幸运地发现了一个秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lucked into a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.78,1:17:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿望的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The secret of the wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.66,1:17:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I wished for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.83,1:17:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者别人为我许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or someone wished for it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.25,1:17:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你的愿望  殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you wish for, Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.50,1:17:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来为你展示如何实现愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will show you how it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.29,1:17:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的愿望无法实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish for things one cannot attain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.67,1:17:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.55,1:17:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归还我的所有土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of my land to be returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.10,1:17:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的故国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My ancestral realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.97,1:17:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比亚利安王朝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bialyian Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.35,1:17:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并把所有胆敢践踏它的异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for all the heathens who dare trod upon it
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.44,1:18:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远拦在外面  让它重复昔日辉煌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be kept out forever, so that its glory may be renewed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.44,1:18:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的愿望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish for that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.57,1:18:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我深切的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish for that deeply.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.70,1:18:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your wish is granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.20,1:18:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为回报  你的石油给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in return, I will take your oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.21,1:18:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真把我逗乐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You truly delight me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.55,1:18:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know so little.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.59,1:18:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把石油都卖给沙特人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sold my oil to the Saudis.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.30,1:18:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是个傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a silly man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.23,1:18:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就把你的安保团队给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will take your security team
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.61,1:18:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人留在这里  失去全部防备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave you here with nothing to defend yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.32,1:18:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着面对必将到来的怒火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against the wrath you most certainly will face.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.12,1:19:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殿下  奇迹发生了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.45,1:19:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下  停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.37,1:19:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.45,1:19:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻停下来  我跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop what you're doing now! I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.24,1:19:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我命令你停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I command you to stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.21,1:19:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.00,1:19:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下  停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.54,1:19:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这堵不可思议  无法解释的墙似乎是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This unbelievable and unexplainable wall appears to
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.77,1:19:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赛义德·本·阿比多斯酋长的杰作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somehow be the work of Emir Said Bin Abydos.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.13,1:19:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据政府报告说  突然出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The government is reporting old rulings have emerged
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认可他的土地所有权的旧裁决书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acknowledging his claim to the land.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.90,1:20:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.57,1:20:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.28,1:20:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直说没事  但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep saying that, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.16,1:20:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.29,1:20:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是麦克斯·罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was Max Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.62,1:20:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.25,1:20:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辆车能卖给我们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.48,1:20:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把他们解决掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of them, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.15,1:21:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.10,1:21:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.57,1:21:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.58,1:21:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刹车还能用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brakes still work.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.30,1:24:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦克斯·罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max Lord,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.55,1:24:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让自己和所有人都陷入了极大的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're putting yourself and everyone else in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.10,1:24:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得把那块石头交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to give me the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.18,1:24:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石头去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.43,1:24:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.66,1:25:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.83,1:25:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.81,1:26:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我们最近的石油大亨是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who's the next closest person with oil?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.44,1:26:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.86,1:26:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离公路
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.16,1:26:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana. Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.50,1:26:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  你这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God. What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.71,1:26:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个匪夷所思的现象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A truly bizarre phenomenon
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.05,1:26:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 被称为神墙  - 发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- that is being called the Divine Wall. - What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.22,1:26:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个无法解释的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an unexplainable event
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.80,1:26:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致埃及最贫穷社区的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that now sees Egypt's poorest communities
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.89,1:26:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一淡水供应被切断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}entirely cut off from their only supply of fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.93,1:26:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏联宣布将认可酋长的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An already tense situation now escalating as the Soviet Union
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.79,1:27:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使本就紧张的局势趋于白热化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}announces they will recognize the Emir's claim.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.87,1:27:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不会吧  - 而埃及的长期盟友  美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no. - The United States, a longtime ally of Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.20,1:27:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,则宣布要站在埃及政府一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has declared their intention to side with the government.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.70,1:27:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国内方面也是一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bedlam on the home front now as well
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.25,1:27:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,令人震惊的消息称\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the shocking news that
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.41,1:27:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国商人麦克斯·罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American businessman Max Lord
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.63,1:27:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫名占有了全球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has somehow come into possession
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.48,1:27:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超过一半的石油储备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of over half of the world's oil reserves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.15,1:27:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石油界的动荡导致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The instability in the oil community has resulted
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.91,1:27:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国的汽油需求暴涨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a nationwide run on gas,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.85,1:27:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专家正做好准备迎接...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and experts are girding themselves...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.32,1:27:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.18,1:27:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉  是我  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara, it's Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.55,1:27:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有没有...  - 有  算是有点眉目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you... - Yeah. Uh, well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.47,1:27:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没查明石头的具体来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't figured out exactly what the stone is,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.79,1:27:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我找到了相关的历史照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've found historical images of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.87,1:27:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From where?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.74,1:27:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪就怪在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the weird thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.22,1:27:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球各地都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.82,1:27:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它首先出现在约四千年前的印度河谷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It first appeared in the Indus Valley almost 4,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.64,1:27:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公元前146年又在迦太基突然出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It popped up again in Carthage in 146 BC.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.37,1:27:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公元4年  库施帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kush, 4 AD.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.29,1:27:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗慕路斯  西罗马帝国末代皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulus, the last Emperor of Rome,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.34,1:27:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在476年被刺杀时手里就拿着这块石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had it on him when he was assassinated in 476.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.53,1:27:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于它的最后记载是在一座无名死城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last record is in some previously unknown dead city
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.42,1:28:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在玛雅古城附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near Dzibilchaltun.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.82,1:28:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 玛雅文明  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Mayans. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.86,1:28:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  调查到后面都是不了了之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, it just led me to a bunch of dead ends,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.10,1:28:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的最后一条线索也不太可靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my last lead is not that promising.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.67,1:28:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.87,1:28:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了一张传单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A flier I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.91,1:28:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大使馆拿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grabbed it at the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.76,1:28:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个人声称自己是玛雅萨满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some guy advertising to be a Mayan shaman.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.44,1:28:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他在银河唱片行隔壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he literally teaches a course
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.04,1:28:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非法占用的房子里授课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a squat next to Galaxy Records.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.32,1:28:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他知道那块石头的事  - 他是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And he knows about the stone? - So he says.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.90,1:28:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天早上过去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go there in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.10,1:28:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我们在那里见  谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we'll meet you there. And thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.65,1:28:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.50,1:28:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那块石头走遍了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone has traveled the world
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.89,1:28:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎随机出现在不同的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to seemingly random and different places,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.75,1:28:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 但那些地方都有一个共同点  - 是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but they all have one thing in common. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.14,1:28:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些文明都被彻底瓦解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their civilizations collapsed catastrophically.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.28,1:28:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不出任何缘由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without a trace as to why.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.75,1:28:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会觉得是那块石头...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think the stone could have...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.97,1:28:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.60,1:28:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to think, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.74,1:28:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能寄希望我是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only hope I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.92,1:29:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(银河唱片行)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.24,1:29:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴巴吉德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babajide?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.61,1:29:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来得真快  - 早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was fast. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.75,1:29:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.84,1:29:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.10,1:29:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是玛雅人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're a Mayan?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.08,1:29:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  我是世界公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I'm a citizen of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.98,1:29:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.72,1:29:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面写着你叫弗兰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says your name is Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.95,1:29:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我了解的大多都是前世的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Most of what I know is a past-life thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.15,1:29:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不是玛雅人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.39,1:29:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过回答你的问题  没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to answer your question, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.16,1:29:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的曾曾祖父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My great-great-grandfather
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.42,1:30:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给了我这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}left me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.90,1:30:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对此一窍不通  但是有人警告过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know everything about it, but I have been warned
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.26,1:30:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最好别掺和进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm better off that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.13,1:30:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的是  这块石头在数月间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I do know is, it destroyed our people
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.47,1:30:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就毁灭了我们的族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a matter of months.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.08,1:30:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个幸存者埋掉了石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The few survivors, they buried the stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.61,1:30:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永世不得重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never to be exhumed under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.99,1:30:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我能看看吗  - 请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I see that? - Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.79,1:30:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.14,1:30:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.60,1:30:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪卡拉弗里亚·埃罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dechalafrea Ero.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.62,1:30:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.01,1:30:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个很邪恶的神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very bad God.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.26,1:30:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谎言之神  多洛斯  门达修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The God of Lies, Dolos, Mendacius,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.12,1:30:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欺骗公爵  他有很多名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duke of Deception. He's been called by many names.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.23,1:30:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果是他赋予了石头魔力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if he's the one who empowered that stone,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.78,1:30:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中肯定有诈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there has to be a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.15,1:30:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谎言和实现愿望有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do lies have to do with granting wishes?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.20,1:30:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它对我而言更像是块梦想石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems more like a Dreamstone to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.52,1:31:02.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许愿骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wishes with a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.34,1:31:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟《猴爪》里说的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The Monkey's Paw."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.34,1:31:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.84,1:31:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你许下的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beware what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.20,1:31:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会实现你的愿望  但也会夺走你最宝贵的财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It grants your wish, but takes your most valued possession.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.03,1:31:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  你的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana, your powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.36,1:31:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这说不通啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.86,1:31:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么能比你的愿望更加宝贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's more precious than what you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.89,1:31:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要如何才能阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we stop this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.01,1:31:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The legend said
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.90,1:31:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想阻止它  只能毁了石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it can only be stopped by destroying the stone itself
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.19,1:31:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者收回已经实现的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or give back what was given.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.52,1:31:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的族人做不到前者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people couldn't do the first thing
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.16,1:31:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也拒绝做后者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and refused to do the second.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.40,1:31:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今文明已经灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the culture's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.21,1:31:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也不复存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wiped from the face of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.87,1:31:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人放弃自己的愿望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one renounced their wish?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.35,1:31:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但石头已经被毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the stone is already destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.92,1:31:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? When?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.45,1:31:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"就在你眼前"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're looking at it."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.89,1:31:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"就在你眼前"  麦克斯·罗德是这么对我说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're looking at it." That's what Max Lord said to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.50,1:31:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.26,1:31:48.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和石头化为一体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's become it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.31,1:31:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how would that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.20,1:31:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他许的愿是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if he wished for...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.17,1:32:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这太疯狂了  不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's crazy. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.06,1:32:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们毁了石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.29,1:32:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消灭他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we destroy him...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.37,1:32:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的愿望都会被收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the wishes go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.28,1:32:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢  不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.19,1:32:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要参与这事  不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna be a part of that. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.26,1:32:16.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者所有人都放弃愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or if everyone renounces their wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.28,1:32:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定还有更好的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there has to be a better way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.50,1:32:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.67,1:32:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.27,1:32:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在掌握的信息还不够  不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know enough. We just don't know enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.27,1:32:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但可以确定的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what we do know is that
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.45,1:32:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得在他实现更多愿望之前阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need to stop him before he grants any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.58,1:32:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他可能还不够  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stopping him might not be enough, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.23,1:32:36.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经有那么多愿望实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wishes have been made.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.96,1:32:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.70,1:32:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.51,1:32:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本就看不上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I want any of these people in the club anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.07,1:32:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把他们赶走吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we tell them they're not invited?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.38,1:32:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.40,1:32:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 联邦通讯委员会说我们不能...  - FCC啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The FCC said we couldn't... - Oh, the FCC.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.74,1:33:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还BBB  FBD呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The BBB, the FBD.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.89,1:33:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是阻碍我成功的阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a conspiracy against my success.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.52,1:33:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们眼红了  没错  下一个是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're jealous. That's why. Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.87,1:33:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是谁  - 你要找的人都来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's next? - Well, everyone you asked for,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.26,1:33:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钟赖  克拉吉先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lai Zhong, Mr. Khalaji,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.53,1:33:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有抢了你广告时段的电视福音布道者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that televangelist who stole your slot.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.46,1:33:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今晚还要陪阿里斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have Alistair for the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.38,1:33:20.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要陪阿里斯特吗  我要陪他多少个周末啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair? Again? How many weekends do I have?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.42,1:33:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么时候  今晚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What? When? Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.81,1:33:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here already.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.27,1:33:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈妈和男友在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His mom is with her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.31,1:33:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请钟先生进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in Mr. Zhong, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.64,1:33:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给阿里斯特买匹小马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And buy Alistair a pony.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.76,1:33:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  赛车  给他买辆赛车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! A race car. Get him a race car.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.39,1:33:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始吧  赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get to it, Lai.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.47,1:33:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.18,1:33:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.87,1:33:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.78,1:33:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗  说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Truly?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.73,1:34:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏联站在了伊朗一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Soviets have sided with Iran.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.01,1:34:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随着动荡的蔓延  伊拉克正准备自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iraq is preparing to defend ourselves, as unrest spreads.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.32,1:34:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need? What do you...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.44,1:34:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.53,1:34:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性爱录像处理掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider the sex tape gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.71,1:34:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死的  如果我得继续这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And God darn it, if I have to keep doing this
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.82,1:34:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个接一个地问...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one by one, by one, by one...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.82,1:34:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的健康状况如何  - 这个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's your health? - Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.64,1:34:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget that.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.49,1:34:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你整个教会的教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will take your entire congregation
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.61,1:34:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有广告时段给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your time slot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.36,1:34:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.41,1:34:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祈祷的时候  能不能让他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they pray, is there any way I could get all of them to...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.71,1:34:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都握住我的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}join hands with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.31,1:34:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们说"我希望"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And simply say, "I wish"
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.00,1:34:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是"我祈祷"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than, "I pray"?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.20,1:34:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样能行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would that even work?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.86,1:34:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.53,1:34:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要找个办法同时接触到很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to find a way to touch a lot of people at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.06,1:34:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  警察来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. The police are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.98,1:34:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为你的安保团队没有行动权限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're challenging the jurisdiction of your security team.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.06,1:34:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.41,1:34:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不行  再找个人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't working. Bring in someone new.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.32,1:34:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.64,1:34:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, beat it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.15,1:35:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.95,1:35:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你了  伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.74,1:35:16.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来  跟爸爸坐下来  对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Sit down with Daddy. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.61,1:35:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, your dad
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正处在千钧一发的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is on the absolute precipice of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.48,1:35:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我跟你说过我会成为头号人物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when I told you that I would be number one?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.61,1:35:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得吗  你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember? Your dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.83,1:35:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在胜利在望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm inches away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.11,1:35:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这不容易  我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's hard. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.98,1:35:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But listen,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.42,1:35:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你的愿望是什么  我的愿望和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also know what you wish for, and I wish for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.02,1:35:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了吗  我的愿望和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear that? I wish for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.12,1:35:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望能和你在一起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wish I could be with you...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.39,1:35:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.75,1:35:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的愿望不能这么用  阿里斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't use your one wish like that, Alistair.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.60,1:35:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能许愿要你已经拥有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wish for something that you already have.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.47,1:35:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要许愿变得伟大  获得成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish for greatness, for success.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.32,1:35:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我做这一切的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm doing all of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.58,1:35:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不明白我伟大就是你伟大吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see that my greatness is your greatness?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.91,1:36:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我希望你变得伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I wish for your greatness.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.31,1:36:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.62,1:36:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.55,1:36:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非常爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.88,1:36:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保证  总有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I promise you, one day,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.80,1:36:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything is going to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.35,1:36:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天  你会感谢我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one day, you'll thank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.53,1:36:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在  我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But right now, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.66,1:36:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你和爱默生待在一起  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, I need you to stay here with Emerson, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.77,1:36:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很快就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.80,1:36:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.73,1:36:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你  你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. You.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.38,1:36:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.51,1:36:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不希望我今天能和总统会面吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you wish I had an audience with the President today?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.30,1:36:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.29,1:37:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有  很高兴你重视我的意见  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And can I tell you how happy I am that you value my opinion, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.93,1:37:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我之前问过你的愿望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Have I asked for your wish before?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.60,1:37:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天问过  我说想要一辆保时捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday. A Porsche.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.72,1:37:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些助理怎么都想要保时捷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with you aides and Porsches?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.60,1:37:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.56,1:37:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.50,1:37:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's traffic?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.20,1:37:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,堵死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.28,1:37:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不希望不堵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you wish it wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.60,1:37:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所到之处都像摩西分开红海一样畅通无阻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that everywhere you went parted like the great Red Sea?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.00,1:37:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然希望  可惜那不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I wish that. Sadly, ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.04,1:37:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.52,1:37:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回家  外面不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.08,1:37:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙特大使馆发生了暴动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a riot at the Saudi Embassy
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.16,1:37:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上到处都是保时捷横冲直撞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there are Porsches racing up and down the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.68,1:37:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走  这世界疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. It's mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.64,1:37:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我的奶牛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my cows.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.06,1:37:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟一个人说我想要一座农场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told a man I wanted a farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.42,1:37:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没说是在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.43,1:38:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.40,1:39:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(特雷弗农场)
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.75,1:39:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  我知道这很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana, I know it's been hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.61,1:39:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不知道  你不懂  - 可是我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't know. You don't. - But we...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.88,1:39:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再这样下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.32,1:39:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我没法跟你谈这件事  - 我们不得不谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't talk about this. - We have to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.44,1:39:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫  我没法谈这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, I can't talk about this!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.06,1:39:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都在付出  付出一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give everything I have, every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.44,1:39:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm happy to.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.57,1:39:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯独只有一个愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this one thing...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.20,1:39:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来我想要的只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all that I've wanted for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.77,1:39:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想要你  只有你能让我快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only joy I've had or even asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.05,1:39:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.99,1:39:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这太荒唐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.53,1:39:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这世界上多得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a world out there full of
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.71,1:39:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我更好的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so many better guys, for one.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.07,1:39:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如这家伙  他怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, how about this guy? How about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.44,1:39:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要他  我要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want him. I want you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.20,1:39:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么就不能满足我这一个愿望  史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, for once, can't I just have this one thing, Steve?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.62,1:39:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.19,1:40:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure we have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.65,1:40:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I do have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.40,1:40:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能放弃你  不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't give you up. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.01,1:40:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会放弃  所以我们要阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I won't. So we need to stop him
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.28,1:40:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法保住你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we can figure that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.58,1:40:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.24,1:40:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.99,1:40:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.10,1:40:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.53,1:40:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我那个世界的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my culture.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.53,1:40:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个古代亚马逊战士的盔甲  我们最伟大的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The armor of an ancient Amazon warrior. One of our greatest.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.22,1:40:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很大啊  这是一整套吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's huge. This whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.90,1:40:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么材料做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it made out of?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.07,1:40:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.86,1:41:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.87,1:41:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思  我没有说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? I haven't lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.56,1:41:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,套索不仅能让你说真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lasso does more than just make you tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.29,1:41:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能让你看到真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can make you see it, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.25,1:41:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫阿斯忒瑞亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her name was Asteria.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.04,1:41:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我们最伟大的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was our greatest warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.24,1:41:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类奴役亚马逊人之后  我母亲解放了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When mankind enslaved the Amazons, my mother freed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.75,1:41:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是必须有人留下来挡住人潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But someone had to stay behind to hold back the tide of men
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.78,1:41:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人才能逃往天堂岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the others could escape to Themyscira.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.07,1:41:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的族人用他们所有的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people gave up all of their armor
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.96,1:41:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为她制作出一套能抵挡全世界的战服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make her one suit strong enough to take on the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.43,1:41:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯忒瑞亚为他人的幸福牺牲了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Asteria sacrificed herself for a better day for others.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.58,1:41:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.65,1:41:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.05,1:41:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚来这里时找过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I came here, I searched for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.29,1:41:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只找到她的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all I could find was her armor.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.75,1:41:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.51,1:42:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he going?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.28,1:42:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.45,1:42:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  戴安娜  你要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana, Diana! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.86,1:42:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪里  - 史蒂夫  我得去  你留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - Steve, I'm going. You need to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.88,1:42:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.65,1:42:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量越来越弱了  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're getting weaker, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.42,1:42:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 万一你摔下去呢  - 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if you fall? - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.64,1:42:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能会  我们都说不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might. We don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.73,1:42:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有别的办法能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be another way in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.49,1:42:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything okay, Mr. President?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.87,1:42:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.06,1:42:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好奇怪  我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something very strange. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.53,1:42:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为我在另一个地方  突然...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was somewhere else entirely. Suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.29,1:43:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  很忙乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway. Hectic times.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.34,1:43:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回避一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.83,1:43:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.99,1:43:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 卡尔  - 戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carl. - Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.61,1:43:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好  - 真荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi. - What a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.64,1:43:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你真好  最近怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you. How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.56,1:43:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很好  - 这是史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - This is Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.24,1:43:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫  这是卡尔  我同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, this is Carl. My colleague.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.35,1:43:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.63,1:43:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we shall.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.21,1:43:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  罗德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Mr. Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.92,1:43:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话  我都不知道这次会面是要谈什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I don't even know what we're supposed to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.11,1:43:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就谈这个  总统先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly that, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.45,1:43:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这忙乱的日子  狂热的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These hectic days, hectic times.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.71,1:43:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.64,1:43:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些并不算白宫里我最喜欢的半身像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These aren't exactly my favorite of the busts on display here,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.83,1:43:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有张小画能排到我心目中的前十位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a little picture of my top ten,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.85,1:43:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勉强可以算前五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe top five at a push.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.73,1:43:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的东西也许你会感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here's something up ahead that will interest you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.07,1:43:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些地砖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are floor tiles
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.64,1:43:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初是简·林肯铺的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}originally laid by none other than Jan Lincoln,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.83,1:43:59.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位不出名的亚伯拉罕后代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little-known descendent of Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.38,1:44:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你遇到麻烦了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're having some troubles?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.09,1:44:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦突然无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.48,1:44:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古巴  埃及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuba, Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.31,1:44:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有国内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.55,1:44:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但苏联...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Russia...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.39,1:44:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别棘手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.08,1:44:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感谢你的关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your concern,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.53,1:44:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在再多的钱也帮不了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but all the money in the world won't help us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.62,1:44:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要给你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not money I'm offering.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.30,1:44:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.85,1:44:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是有信仰的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a man of faith,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.92,1:44:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我最近非常幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have been very blessed lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.19,1:44:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想把我的运气分享给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to share my blessing with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.03,1:44:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是正面思考的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power of positive thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.26,1:44:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.66,1:44:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统先生  告诉我你需要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell me, Mr. President, what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.40,1:44:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是对着我说  而是对着宇宙说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're not speaking to me here, but to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.27,1:44:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.49,1:44:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是想要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is there to wish for but more?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.20,1:45:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更多核武器  比他们更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More nuclear weapons. More than they have.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.33,1:45:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离他们更近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.06,1:45:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我有那些核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I just had that in place,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.09,1:45:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就必须听我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then they would have to listen to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.16,1:45:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想法不错  那我就帮你实现...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nice thought. And I grant you...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.95,1:45:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.61,1:45:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我要什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know what I'd like?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.23,1:45:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你所有的势力  影响力  权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would want all of your power, influence, authority.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.20,1:45:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人对你的尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the respect you command
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.68,1:45:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人对你的服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the command everyone must respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.71,1:45:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what else is there?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.88,1:45:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉你的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell your people I would appreciate
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.78,1:45:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不要来干涉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}absolutely no interference whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.46,1:45:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有税务和法律  没有任何限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No taxes, no rule of law, no limits.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.93,1:45:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我当成一个有绝对自治权的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treat me like a foreign nation with absolute autonomy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.55,1:45:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.27,1:45:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.54,1:46:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.62,1:46:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球广播卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global Broadcast Satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.35,1:46:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个绝密计划  能让我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top-secret program that enables us
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.06,1:46:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制全世界所有广播系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to override any broadcast system in the world
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.38,1:46:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防我们需要与敌国国民直接接触\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in case we need direct contact with the people of an enemy state.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.47,1:46:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.09,1:46:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要控制所有人的电视吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're taking over everyone's TVs?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.11,1:46:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.61,1:46:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用粒子束技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It uses particle beam technology,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.35,1:46:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像星球大战计划一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like the Star Wars program.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.35,1:46:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.12,1:46:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说在粒子信号覆盖的区域内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, it bathes the landscape in a signal of particles
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.21,1:46:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粒子可以进入并操控所接触到的任何设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that goes in and fiddles with any technology it touches.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.69,1:46:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管设备新旧  想播放什么都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New or old. Broadcast whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.54,1:46:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.19,1:46:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说"接触"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said "touches"?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.72,1:46:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发送的这些粒子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As in the particles you are sending...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.41,1:46:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能接触一切吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are touching everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.36,1:46:51.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个比喻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a figure of speech,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.37,1:46:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.15,1:46:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就是这样跟我解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how it was explained to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.27,1:46:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要立刻使用这颗卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need immediate access to this satellite.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.46,1:46:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派直升机送我过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a chopper to get me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.43,1:47:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  先生  马上就办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.84,1:47:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真是神通广大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, aren't you resourceful?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.97,1:47:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁你还没造成更多伤害  跟我走吧  麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me before you do any more damage, Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.04,1:47:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.89,1:47:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把这个女人除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove this woman, please...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.55,1:47:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别手软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}permanently.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.98,1:47:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧  - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.43,1:47:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  史蒂夫  你不能用这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Steve. You can't use that.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.91,1:47:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是无辜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.27,1:48:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这招不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's neat.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.81,1:49:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.61,1:49:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能让你这么做  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let you do this, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.20,1:49:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉  什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara. What...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.45,1:49:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么...  - 我不能让你阻止麦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How... - I can't let you stop Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.36,1:49:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是只有你的愿望会被收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the only one with something to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.42,1:49:53.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到许愿像你一样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out wishing to be like you...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.80,1:49:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带来了惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came with some surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.40,1:50:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.10,1:50:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 举起手来  - 举起手来  举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hands up. - Hands up, hands up.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.09,1:50:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.79,1:50:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 举起手来  - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hands up! - Now! Now, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.75,1:50:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.78,1:50:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真恩爱  保护自己的爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, how sweet, defending your love. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.24,1:50:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愿望是什么  变成真正的活人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you wish for? Do you wanna be a real boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.87,1:50:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.64,1:50:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望别跟你铐在一起  但还是铐上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just not to be handcuffed to you, but now I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.56,1:50:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚学会这招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just learned that.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.41,1:51:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉  住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.02,1:51:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.62,1:51:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不明白自己许了什么愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.03,1:51:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是你想的那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.26,1:51:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你理解不了  也承受不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't possibly understand or handle...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.86,1:51:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我理解不了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I can't possibly understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.03,1:51:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这么傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumb little old me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.71,1:51:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又傻又可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumb little, poor little
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.18,1:51:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人在乎我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing, nobody me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.41,1:51:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本承受不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't possibly handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.12,1:51:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  芭芭拉  我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Barbara. That's not what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.45,1:51:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是感觉得心应手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm handling it beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.57,1:51:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not giving it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.39,1:52:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.24,1:52:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.36,1:52:22.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都停手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.40,1:52:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许伤害她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody hurts her.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.22,1:52:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们伤害不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They couldn't if they tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.90,1:52:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你生来就拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've always had everything,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.19,1:52:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我这样的人一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while people like me have had nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.35,1:52:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在轮到我了  你别想从我手中夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now it's my turn. And you are not taking it from me. Ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.17,1:52:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你付出了什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is it costing you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.77,1:52:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我付出了什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it costing me?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.46,1:52:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果跟猴爪一样  那么代价与愿望同等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's the monkey's paw, it takes as much as it gives.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.82,1:52:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  你变强大了  但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you're strong, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.97,1:52:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去了什么  芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what did you lose, Barbara?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.06,1:53:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的热情  你的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your warmth, your joy,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.34,1:53:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的人性呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your humanity?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.44,1:53:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你攻击了无辜的人  芭芭拉  看看你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're attacking innocent men, Barbara. Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.75,1:53:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.17,1:53:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你付出了什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it costing you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.96,1:53:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.69,1:53:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好习惯一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.44,1:53:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你去追捕麦克斯·罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go after Max Lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.20,1:53:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者伤害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or hurt him in any way,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.97,1:53:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会消灭你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.52,1:53:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.03,1:53:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.72,1:53:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.37,1:54:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能加一个人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Room for one more?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.99,1:54:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生  你得等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, you need to wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.39,1:54:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 总统现在正在开会  - 我们要见总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The President has a meeting right now. - We need to see the President.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.36,1:54:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他必须明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} He needs to be told.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.90,1:54:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 事关生死存亡  - 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is a matter of life and death. - What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.00,1:54:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏联的预警系统发现了我们的新核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Soviets' early detection system picked up our new nukes.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.41,1:54:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么新核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What new nukes?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.44,1:54:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百枚核弹头刚被激活  准备发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred warheads just went online, ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.86,1:54:43.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为这是战争行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're taking this as an act of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.93,1:54:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在准备反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepping to return fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.74,1:54:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反击  什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.74,1:54:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.90,1:54:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但看起来不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not how it looks.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.09,1:54:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果处境对调  我们早就反击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'd fire for less.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.50,1:54:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.53,1:55:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闯红灯了  你看都没看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew through that light right there! You didn't even see!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.24,1:55:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你眼瞎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you not see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.47,1:55:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随着美苏两国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riots across the world erupting
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.69,1:55:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终止对话  宣布开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as America and the Soviet Union end communication,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.18,1:55:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界各地暴乱四起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}declaring war!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.77,1:55:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道前因后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one knows any more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.90,1:55:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是空前危机当前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as you can imagine with what's at stake,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.34,1:55:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,华盛顿特区市中心陷入了疯狂之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there has been madness down here in downtown Washington, D.C.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.12,1:55:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国民警卫队已出动...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The national guard has been brought in...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.06,1:55:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意  注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention! Attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.59,1:55:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据行政命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By executive order,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.94,1:55:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有民众必须立即撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all civilians must immediately evacuate
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.50,1:55:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西北3街与西北12街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Pennsylvania Avenue corridor
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.60,1:55:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之间的宾夕法尼亚大道路段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between 3rd and 12th streets northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.26,1:55:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们面临的是大灾难的末期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the final days of tribulation that is happening to us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.26,1:55:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.30,1:55:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看到自己罪行的恶果了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see what your sinfulness has done?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.36,1:55:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your greed?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.27,1:55:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得做点什么  你得做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta do something! You gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.75,1:55:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  这边  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! This way! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.33,1:56:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riley!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.28,1:56:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.79,1:56:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莱丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riley!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.06,1:56:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.62,1:56:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 到处都一片混乱  - 莱丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's chaos out here. - Riley!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.07,1:56:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么办  我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do? I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.74,1:56:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.23,1:56:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.58,1:56:22.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.19,1:56:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴安娜  听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diana, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.64,1:56:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我度过了精彩的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a great life.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.75,1:56:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.14,1:56:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你让我的人生更美好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you only made it better.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.41,1:56:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你知道应该做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.75,1:56:45.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world needs you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.00,1:56:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吗  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.90,1:57:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不会爱上别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never love again.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.41,1:57:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望这话不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray that isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.53,1:57:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界那么大  那么美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a wonderful, big world out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.62,1:57:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个疯狂的新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crazy new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.50,1:57:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴能来看一看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am so happy I got to see it...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.46,1:57:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它值得你拯救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it deserves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.54,1:57:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不出再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.89,1:57:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不出再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.56,1:57:40.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.45,1:57:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.12,1:58:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会永远爱你  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll always love you, Diana,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.05,1:58:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no matter where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.92,1:58:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.43,1:58:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我放弃我的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I renounce my wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.05,1:59:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.70,1:59:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是风和气流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only wind and air...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.12,1:59:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驭气流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how to ride it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.16,1:59:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乘风而行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.20,2:00:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许愿了  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a wish too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.99,2:00:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿望很狡猾  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're a bitch, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.91,2:00:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make you pay a price, but
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.55,2:00:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我从不遵守规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been one for rules.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.33,2:00:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所幸我有逆转的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luckily, I have a way to reverse it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.86,2:00:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永不满足才能生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is always more.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:53.57,2:00:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但每人只能许一个愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you only get one wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:55.32,2:00:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但实现愿望的人是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I, my dear, grant the wishes.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.16,2:01:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我能要求回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I take what I want in return.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.50,2:01:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我想要什么  都能从别人身上夺取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in this world someone doesn't have.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.38,2:01:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会重塑我的健康  用一个个愿望换一个个器官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll rebuild my health, wish by wish, organ by organ...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.80,2:01:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有必要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.30,2:01:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将无人能敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.72,2:01:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.47,2:01:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.64,2:01:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在很慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm feeling generous.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.06,2:01:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再像任何人一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be like anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.12,2:01:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想成为头号人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be number one.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.13,2:01:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶级掠食者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An apex predator,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.13,2:01:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前所未有的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like nothing there's ever been before.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.72,2:01:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the way you think.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.64,2:01:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.99,2:02:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该收到命令了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard we were coming, I presume?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.87,2:02:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一次能控制多少广播信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many broadcasting signals can I take over at once?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.33,2:02:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想控制多少都行  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, as many as you like, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.12,2:02:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要控制所有的信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take all of them.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.67,2:02:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.75,2:02:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不希望我能成功吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I sure wish this works for me. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.38,2:02:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然希望  先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.80,2:02:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯光  摄像机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights, camera...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.01,2:02:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,12号  9号  16号  开始传送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, stations 12, 9, 16, go transmit.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.89,2:02:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立即传送  16号  9号  12号  收到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need it now. 16, 9, 12. Do you receive?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.77,2:02:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到  最大功率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy. Maximum power.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.06,2:02:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  准备开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Moving forward now.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.15,2:02:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球传送倒计时  五  四  三  二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global transmission in five, four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.74,2:02:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Citizens of the world,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.12,2:02:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容我介绍一下自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.58,2:02:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是麦克斯·罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Max Lord,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.33,2:02:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将要改变你们的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm here to change your life.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.78,2:02:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.45,2:03:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.58,2:03:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.58,2:03:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何梦想  都能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you dream of, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.54,2:03:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要敢想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can dream it...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.27,2:03:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.35,2:03:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can achieve it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.06,2:03:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要看着我的双眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So just look into my eyes...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.98,2:03:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.66,2:03:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何梦想  都能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you dream of, have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.88,2:03:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想成名
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.21,2:03:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快许愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.41,2:03:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想大富大贵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to be rich?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.21,2:03:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想权力在握吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to be powerful?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.59,2:03:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行吧  随你怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.71,2:03:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大声许愿  - 你知道我有什么愿望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Say it out loud! - You know what I wish?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.30,2:03:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么愿望  - 我希望你们这帮爱尔兰混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? What? - I wish all you Irish bastards
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.13,2:03:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通通被赶回老家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would get sent back to where you came from!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.21,2:03:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗  那我希望你去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Well, I wish you'd drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.93,2:03:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.27,2:03:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快许愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your wish!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.68,2:03:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take what's yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.64,2:03:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.60,2:03:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.35,2:03:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望有一百万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish for a million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.87,2:03:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要有自己的导弹
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.58,2:04:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望成为国王
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.08,2:04:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望我们有核武器
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.82,2:04:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.79,2:04:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.25,2:04:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何梦想  都能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you dream of, have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.26,2:04:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.47,2:04:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.35,2:04:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.06,2:04:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, say it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.27,2:04:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大声许愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.06,2:04:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  "我希望"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. "I wish."
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.27,2:04:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去  拿去吧  都是你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it. Take it. It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.23,2:04:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all yours for the taking!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.33,2:04:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为交换  你的健康和你的体力给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I... I take your health and your strength.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.04,2:04:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的愤怒和你的体魄给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give her your rage and your prowess.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.87,2:04:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的力量给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I take your power.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.13,2:05:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的生命力给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take your life force.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.88,2:05:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.03,2:05:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.79,2:05:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.58,2:05:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.56,2:05:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.40,2:05:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你在我身边  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you were here, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.65,2:05:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你回来  爸爸  求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you'd come back. Daddy, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.51,2:05:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们只要许下愿望  - 我还在这里  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All you have to do is wish for it. - I'm still here, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.72,2:05:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.35,2:06:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.15,2:06:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:35.26,2:08:35.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.34,2:08:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放弃了你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You renounced your wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.70,2:08:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得不放弃  你也要放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to. And so do you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.73,2:08:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谎言不会带来好结果  芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing good is born from lies, Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.44,2:08:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在浪费宝贵的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're wasting precious time.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.10,2:08:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了现在  你还是瞧不起我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now, patronizing me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.87,2:10:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芭芭拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barbara...
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.70,2:10:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你还有理智  求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're in there. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.79,2:10:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了  放弃你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, renounce your wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.29,2:10:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.16,2:10:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.04,2:10:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renounce your wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.75,2:10:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.30,2:10:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.22,2:11:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.68,2:11:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快许愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wish for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:26.30,2:11:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's yours now.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.18,2:11:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只要大声许愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:31.90,2:11:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许下愿望  任何愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a wish. Any wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.60,2:11:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我的双眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look into my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.65,2:11:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们梦寐以求的一切  都能实现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and everything you've been waiting for, it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.23,2:11:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.45,2:11:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.74,2:11:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.99,2:11:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:49.58,2:11:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.58,2:11:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 实现了  - 你为什么要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Granted. - Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.33,2:11:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拥有的还不够多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you have enough?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.13,2:11:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not more?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.00,2:11:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不许愿要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not wish for more?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.92,2:12:02.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们不知道你夺走了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they don't know what you're taking from them.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.30,2:12:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要就是想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want what we want.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.38,2:12:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许愿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you did.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.18,2:12:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,许愿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.01,2:12:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:21.07,2:12:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:25.03,2:12:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了  戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late, Diana.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.95,2:12:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经听到我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They already heard me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.25,2:12:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经许下愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already wished!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.83,2:12:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些还没许愿的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those that haven't yet...
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.96,2:12:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会许愿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.14,2:12:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.48,2:13:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.27,2:13:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.49,2:13:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的戴安娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Diana.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.87,2:13:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要逞英雄呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why be such a hero?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.50,2:13:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要加入我的阵营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have kept your pilot and your powers,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.96,2:13:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就能同时拥有爱人和力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if only you'd join me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.24,2:13:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要重新考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna reconsider?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.29,2:13:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个宽宏大量的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a forgiving man!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.54,2:13:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要他回来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want him back?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.67,2:13:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要许愿就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.81,2:13:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have it all!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.98,2:13:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have to want it!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.24,2:13:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最想要的就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never wanted anything more.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.23,2:13:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's gone...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.50,2:14:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才是真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.49,2:14:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万事皆有代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And everything has a price.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:07.00,2:14:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我不愿付这个代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One I'm not willing to pay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.43,2:14:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:17.92,2:14:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界本来就很美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This world was a beautiful place just as it was...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.05,2:14:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人能拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you cannot have it all.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.55,2:14:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只能拥有真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can only have the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.15,2:14:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真相就足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the truth is enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.20,2:14:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真相是美好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.16,2:14:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以看看这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So look at this world...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.21,2:14:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你的愿望让世界付出了什么代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and look at what your wish is costing it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.67,2:14:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要成为英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be the hero.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.63,2:14:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能挽救一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you can save the day.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.60,2:14:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想拯救这个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Renounce your wish
Dialogue: 0,2:14:59.77,2:15:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就放弃你的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to save this world.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.56,2:15:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.27,2:15:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易轮到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it's finally my turn?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.40,2:15:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个世界是属于我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.07,2:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你阻止不了我  谁也阻止不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stop me. No one can!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.46,2:15:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在对你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.34,2:15:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在对世界上其他所有人说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was talking to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.01,2:15:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为并非只有你遭受痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're not the only one who has suffered.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.68,2:15:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants more.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:46.07,2:15:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要逝者归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants them back.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.94,2:15:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要不再害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who doesn't want to be afraid anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.33,2:15:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.62,2:16:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:00.83,2:16:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切断信号  停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the signal! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.54,2:16:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or frightened.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.54,2:16:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再无力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or powerless.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.25,2:16:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为并非只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause you're not the only one
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.00,2:16:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望世界变成截然不同的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who imagined a world where everything was different.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.76,2:16:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于变得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.19,2:16:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成一个能感受到爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world where they were loved
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.11,2:16:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感受到理解与认同的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and seen, and appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.24,2:16:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.07,2:16:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.33,2:16:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他连英语都不会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't even speak English.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:40.57,2:16:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他吃的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he eating?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.33,2:16:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看他的鞋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at his shoes!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.95,2:16:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.73,2:17:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(黑金合作社)
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.77,2:17:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你为此付出了什么代价呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is it costing you?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.61,2:17:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到真相了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the truth?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.62,2:17:25.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.04,2:17:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.80,2:17:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不断有新的导弹出现
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.68,2:17:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们别无选择
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.64,2:17:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备发射
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.09,2:17:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄国人正在发射导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Russians are launching.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.73,2:17:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们受命进行反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got orders to counter.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.93,2:17:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.99,2:18:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.91,2:18:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency alert.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.52,2:18:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请在四分钟内进入避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have four minutes to find shelter.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:13.84,2:18:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alistair!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.17,2:18:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son!
